WEBVTT

01:43.290 --> 01:45.450
I've got shit luck.

01:48.710 --> 01:50.420
What the heck is that?

01:53.460 --> 01:56.510
A riot, they say. What a pain.

01:56.510 --> 01:57.670
A riot?

01:58.010 --> 02:02.850
Omra's city development plan calls for this area to be sunk under a dam.

02:02.850 --> 02:06.680
The locals are against the plan,
so they barricaded the highway.

02:06.680 --> 02:08.440
Seriously?

02:08.440 --> 02:11.610
But it looks like it'll be resolved soon.

02:11.610 --> 02:12.770
Why's that?

02:12.770 --> 02:15.980
Omra's deployed a new weapon.

02:15.980 --> 02:19.530
Look at the sky.
They say something's burning.

02:19.530 --> 02:21.450
A new weapon, huh?

02:21.450 --> 02:22.910
Sounds pretty nasty.

02:23.160 --> 02:25.200
Omra's a scary company.

02:25.200 --> 02:26.910
NAMU AMI DABUTSU.

02:25.200 --> 02:26.910
NOTE: Not NAMU AMIDA BUTSU.

02:34.670 --> 02:38.380
Adjusting landing coordinates. Thank you.

02:38.380 --> 02:40.590
We apologize for the disturbance.

02:49.230 --> 02:50.940
AIYEEAGH...

02:58.740 --> 03:00.860
At the highway, sealed behind the barricade,

03:00.860 --> 03:04.910
the TOTTORIVILLE resistance continued resisting desperately.

03:07.370 --> 03:10.040
AIYEAGGH!

03:16.420 --> 03:18.760
DŌMO, HAJIMEMASHITE.

03:18.760 --> 03:20.340
I am Motor YABU.

03:20.340 --> 03:22.880
I will now accept your surrender.

03:22.880 --> 03:24.850
Omra is a compassionate company.

03:27.640 --> 03:28.890
I surrender!

03:29.470 --> 03:30.310
Don't kill me!

03:30.770 --> 03:32.100
Positive.

03:32.100 --> 03:33.980
I accept your surrender.

03:33.980 --> 03:36.020
Thank you very much.

03:36.020 --> 03:37.480
Uhwuhhh?

03:37.480 --> 03:39.690
AIYEAGGH!

03:44.610 --> 03:46.990
I will now accept your surrender.

03:48.620 --> 03:49.540
Go!

03:49.540 --> 03:51.120
I'll handle them!

03:51.120 --> 03:54.290
Tell HQ about these things!

03:54.290 --> 03:56.170
YEEART!

03:58.170 --> 04:00.380
AIYEAGGH!

04:05.260 --> 04:07.720
Everybody's dead!

04:07.720 --> 04:09.720
The Motor YABUs...

04:09.720 --> 04:11.480
Guns don't work on them!

04:11.480 --> 04:13.140
They had Gatling guns...

04:13.140 --> 04:14.600
We're finished!

04:14.600 --> 04:17.520
The Motor YABUs finally showed up, huh?

04:17.520 --> 04:18.980
You know of them?

04:18.980 --> 04:21.740
They're ROBO-NINJAS developed by Omra.

04:18.980 --> 04:21.740
NOTE: ROBO-NINJAS combine the powers of NINJAS and INDUSTRY.

04:21.740 --> 04:23.570
How horrible!

04:23.570 --> 04:28.330
They're sure to press forward and attack us with the Motor YABUs.

04:28.330 --> 04:30.160
Things will get much harder now.

04:35.670 --> 04:38.340
Let's get this party started!

04:38.340 --> 04:39.340
AIYEAGGH!

04:39.750 --> 04:42.380
A-AIYEAAAAGGHGGH!

04:43.260 --> 04:44.340
AIYEAGGH!

04:44.340 --> 04:47.930
Three. Two. One.

04:47.930 --> 04:48.930
HAI!

04:48.930 --> 04:50.430
AIYEEAGH!

04:56.940 --> 04:58.810
Well, shit.

05:03.780 --> 05:04.990
YEEART!

05:19.130 --> 05:21.460
AIYEEAGH!

05:29.430 --> 05:30.350
NINJA!

05:30.350 --> 05:31.720
A NINJA! Why?

05:33.640 --> 05:34.810
AIYE—

05:36.560 --> 05:38.650
Where is RAPTURE-SAN?

05:39.230 --> 05:40.860
AIYEAGGH...

05:45.940 --> 05:50.120
What agility! The name ROBO-NINJA isn't just for show!

05:53.740 --> 05:55.080
AIYEAGGH...

05:55.080 --> 05:56.160
Begone!

06:00.000 --> 06:00.880
You...

06:00.880 --> 06:02.920
You're a NINJA?

06:02.920 --> 06:04.250
Indeed.

06:04.250 --> 06:07.380
And DŌMO. I am RAPTURE.

06:09.840 --> 06:11.180
YEEART!

06:16.060 --> 06:18.600
You're a NINJA, huh?

06:21.940 --> 06:26.190
DŌMO, HAJIMEMASHITE.
I am EXPLOSIVE.

06:26.530 --> 06:30.490
DŌMO, EXPLOSIVE-SAN.
I am RAPTURE.

06:30.490 --> 06:32.030
YEEART!

06:36.950 --> 06:40.420
Tricky little JUTSU you've got.
But it's useless.

06:40.750 --> 06:42.250
UWAAARGGHH!

06:46.210 --> 06:49.930
It only takes a second to cause a lifetime of pain.

06:49.930 --> 06:52.430
This whole place is under my control.

06:52.430 --> 06:55.220
And I'm going to make good use of it.

06:55.970 --> 06:58.930
NINJA IKUSA is over in an instant!

06:58.930 --> 07:03.100
How does it feel to leave the battlefield
without even the chance to use your powers,

07:03.100 --> 07:05.110
RAPTURE-SAN?

07:07.690 --> 07:10.400
Another NINJA?

07:10.780 --> 07:13.200
No, I guess not.

07:13.490 --> 07:18.290
Girl, you've got no NINJA SOUL.

07:18.750 --> 07:21.370
Are you pretending to be a NINJA?

07:21.370 --> 07:22.790
YEEART!

07:23.420 --> 07:25.380
H setup complete.

07:29.510 --> 07:30.840
UWAARGH!

07:30.840 --> 07:33.260
Let's see some fireworks.

07:33.260 --> 07:35.680
You're all DABUTSU.

07:33.260 --> 07:35.680
NOTE: DABUTSU means DEAD, like BUDDHA.

07:35.680 --> 07:36.850
I see.

07:36.850 --> 07:39.390
That sounds like a good time.

07:39.390 --> 07:40.520
Who's there?

07:43.810 --> 07:45.310
Nobody's there?

07:46.440 --> 07:47.270
AIYEEAGH!?!

07:47.980 --> 07:51.950
But you're the only one who's going to be lighting up the sky.

07:51.950 --> 07:55.490
Y-You're... NINJA Slayer-SAN!

07:55.740 --> 08:00.870
HAJIMEMASHITE, EXPLOSIVE-SAN, RAPTURE-SAN, and...

08:00.870 --> 08:02.870
DŌMO, Yukano-SAN.

08:03.420 --> 08:04.790
Yukano?

08:04.790 --> 08:06.380
That name...

08:06.380 --> 08:09.130
You've already noticed, haven't you, viewers?

08:09.130 --> 08:14.220
AMNESIA... She is, in fact,
the missing Dragon Yukano!

08:14.220 --> 08:15.090
But...

08:15.340 --> 08:18.720
You've lost your memories, haven't you? I've heard.

08:18.720 --> 08:20.060
I've come to get you.

08:20.060 --> 08:21.770
YEEART!

08:21.770 --> 08:23.310
YEEART!

08:26.690 --> 08:30.820
By the way, that NINJA you're carrying, RAPTURE-SAN,

08:31.070 --> 08:33.320
I planted bombs on him.

08:33.740 --> 08:34.530
What?

08:34.530 --> 08:35.780
Three.

08:37.120 --> 08:39.160
It looks like this is the end for me.

08:39.160 --> 08:41.040
I'm sorry I couldn't tell you anything.

08:41.660 --> 08:42.910
Two.

08:42.910 --> 08:44.410
RAPTURE-SAN!

08:44.410 --> 08:45.670
One.

08:46.750 --> 08:49.710
SAYŌNARA!

08:53.130 --> 08:55.930
What a moving sight!

08:56.260 --> 08:58.720
Yukano, take the leader out of here.

08:58.720 --> 09:01.350
Save the other resistance members.

09:06.850 --> 09:08.980
NINJAS must be slain!

09:08.980 --> 09:13.110
Now come, NINJA Slayer-SAN.

09:13.110 --> 09:15.950
We'll fight fair and square...

09:16.240 --> 09:19.160
And two-on-one!

09:22.160 --> 09:23.660
WASSHOI!

09:27.420 --> 09:28.630
YEEART!

09:29.830 --> 09:32.050
I accept your surrender.

09:32.050 --> 09:33.000
YEEART!

09:42.600 --> 09:43.770
Impossible!

09:47.480 --> 09:48.600
Kaboom!

09:48.600 --> 09:50.480
What happened to my kaboom?!

09:50.480 --> 09:52.900
You saw what happened already, viewers!

09:52.900 --> 10:01.070
NINJA Slayer pulled out all the fuses from the bombs in less than a single second!

10:01.070 --> 10:02.330
YEEART!

10:02.330 --> 10:03.660
GWAARGH!

10:06.040 --> 10:08.290
This can't be!

10:08.290 --> 10:11.580
I haven't even been able to attack!

10:12.040 --> 10:16.260
How does it feel to leave the battlefield
without even the chance to use your powers,

10:16.260 --> 10:17.920
EXPLOSIVE-SAN?

10:17.920 --> 10:20.680
C-Coward!

10:22.100 --> 10:24.970
What are you doing, NINJA Slayer-SAN?

10:24.970 --> 10:28.560
It looked like you were pulling a detonator switch back there.

10:28.560 --> 10:30.810
But I bet they detonate even without it, right?

10:33.060 --> 10:35.570
Don't do it! I'll tell you whatever you want to know!

10:35.570 --> 10:37.940
There's nothing I want to ask you.

10:39.280 --> 10:42.160
I don't want to die!

10:42.160 --> 10:43.910
No mercy!

10:43.910 --> 10:46.490
SAYŌNARA!

10:56.170 --> 10:59.630
DŌMO. You saved us.
It was all thanks to OKAGE-SAMA.

10:56.170 --> 10:59.630
NOTE: OKAGE-SAMA is JAPAN'S SHADOW KING.

10:59.630 --> 11:01.340
Excuse me, where is Yukano?

11:01.340 --> 11:04.010
Er, I mean AMNESIA-SAN?

11:10.730 --> 11:14.480
AMNESIA-SAN wanted me to give you this.

11:16.570 --> 11:19.820
<i>Dear NINJA Slayer-SAN,</i>

11:19.820 --> 11:22.820
<i>You said my name was Yukano,</i>

11:22.820 --> 11:25.780
<i>but unfortunately, I have no memories.</i>

11:25.780 --> 11:29.750
<i>My only home is with the group called IKKI UCHIKOWASHI,</i>

11:29.750 --> 11:32.500
<i>which saved me and took me in.</i>

11:32.500 --> 11:36.130
<i>RAPTURE-SAN and I were going to get married.</i>

11:36.130 --> 11:37.670
<i>It was love at first sight.</i>

11:38.380 --> 11:43.550
<i>I'm going to wait for reinforcements from IKKI UCHIKOWASHI here in TOTTORIVILLE.</i>

11:43.550 --> 11:47.350
<i>And I will mourn for RAPTURE-SAN.</i>

11:47.350 --> 11:50.890
<i>I'm not the person I was in the past.</i>

11:50.890 --> 11:53.440
<i>There is nothing you can do for me.</i>

11:54.100 --> 11:58.360
Thank you for saving me,
and for avenging RAPTURE-SAN...

12:04.030 --> 12:05.950
Give this to Yukano...

12:05.950 --> 12:07.530
To AMNESIA-SAN.

12:16.960 --> 12:18.380
The sun rises.
